also fully cooperate with them, as Article 30(2)(g) of that Regulation requires. A financial entity under that Regulation may ask OPTIMAJET for a signed addendum with the other terms that Article 30 of that Regulation requires. This EULA is written in English, and a translation is for convenience only. Where the law that governs a public body’s procurement requires a text in another language, a translation that OPTIMAJET has approved in writing may be attached to its order and governs that public body’s license to the extent that law requires.

